  "$comment": "Which koonapin://import links a reader accepts (spec: The one-click link), and the list address it then offers to download. url: the address, when the link is accepted; null when it is ignored. pad: before reading, append `with` to `link` until it is at least `to_bytes` bytes long in UTF-8; ok: true when such a link is accepted. Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.",
